## Shared Standard

Follow `{relative-path-to}/GPT_ARCHITECT_REVIEW_STANDARD.md` for the
canonical `/architect` and `/review` contract. (In this kit, that file ships
in `shared-docs/`. Place it at the parent of your projects, e.g.
`../docs/GPT_ARCHITECT_REVIEW_STANDARD.md`, or wherever you've decided
shared cross-project docs live.)

For token efficiency:

- For `/architect`, read only the shared standard's `## /architect` section
  plus `## Handover Contract`.
- For `/review`, read only the shared standard's `## /review` section plus
  `## Handover Contract`.

This file intentionally keeps only project-specific overlays.

